            "notes": "By this point you should have at least 10K credits from Round 1. This is where your build starts to branch out. Play more defensively\u2014healing comes first, while your damage orbs continue to apply steady pressure and income.\n\nYour priority upgrades here are Smart Orbs and Nano Cola. If you can\u2019t afford those, fall back on the optional items I outlined earlier. With extra cash, shift focus based on how your team is performing:\n\nIf your team is struggling, invest in cooldown reduction so you can keep heals and orbs rolling more often.\n\nIf your team is holding their own, lean into ability power to scale your output.\n\nRemember, Round 2 is usually the first point where you can judge how solid your team is. You won\u2019t get a complete picture until the end of this round or into Round 3, but your upgrade choices here set the tone for the rest of the match.",
