            "notes": "At this stage, the game starts to open up and your choices really matter. If you\u2019re getting backlined or dived on consistently, consider picking up LumeriCo Fusion Drive (optional). The shields give you a critical escape tool when a dive is tearing through you. Otherwise, continue focusing on ability power to scale both your heals and damage.\n\nThis round also introduces Optimal Overflow\u2014a perfect fit for this orb-focused build. You\u2019ll be throwing orbs nonstop, and this keeps your ULT and money generation flowing. Smart Orbs remain a permanent core upgrade\u2014never drop it.\n\nFor utility and survival, Extendrils paired with Liquid Nitrogen is a deadly combination. Extendrils helps peel enemies off you, while Liquid Nitrogen punishes supports and squishies who overextend. Together, they not only keep you alive but also build your ult at record speed.\n\nIf you\u2019re short on credits, fall back on the optional items provided earlier. The priority is staying effective with orbs while scaling your survivability.",
